dence":["shiyi-q-65a1cb26cba004bf5dd9"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-3243420eb4fc09f30264","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：字子羽，北海营陵人","evidence":["shiyi-q-a750c78f06cb64fb0023"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-ffd14a762ad014de6af4","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：本姓氏","evidence":["shiyi-q-e634c21b77ad605300a6"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-7f85be299b8417229f97","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：初为县吏，后仕郡","evidence":["shiyi-q-837626b810d13ff5496a"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-7b218e3283c5a7d70d01","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：为傅尽忠，动辄规谏","evidence":["shiyi-q-dfc82aabb7524585d4a7"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-313369b3877e22da39f9","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：事上勤，与人恭","evidence":["shiyi-q-8fd225d80f739b152db1"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-3924dc8c33f9ff50a534","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：不治产业，不受施惠；为屋舍，才足自容","evidence":["shiyi-q-f2bd23994848c41ed15f"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-dcf36c8c93d6eecf4e19","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：其见知信如此","evidence":["shiyi-q-d4aa0a597ababb5cc48b"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-6a3969ef87089e437c75","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：服不精细，食不重膳；拯赡贫困，家无储蓄","evidence":["shiyi-q-c562e5964a85d0c26003"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-2ef802ed3270059c7ec7","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：时时有所进达，未尝言人之短","evidence":["shiyi-q-d5dacfbee24ec9638406"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-1c74f09bb8ec717eb0a0","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：事国数十年，未尝有过","evidence":["shiyi-q-5fef5d97ed5098674b8e"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-925dda7a2151b5c46f73","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：吕壹历白将相大臣，或一人以罪闻者数四，独无以白仪","evidence":["shiyi-q-06aabd8f5a59027cdc7c"]},{"id":"shiyi-m-27f775d3e223acb0553e","kind":"mention","text":"本篇记载：孙权叹曰“使人尽如是仪，当安用科法为”","evidence":["shiyi-q-ade3571569747d47741b"]}],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shiyi-q-066a979c09ea115e1d59","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18ef2ce50d8fb8def8db","layer":"original","quote":"南、鲁二宫初立〖1〗，仪以本职领鲁王傅。仪嫌二宫相近切〖2〗，乃上疏曰：“臣窃以鲁王天挺懿德〖3〗，兼资文武；当今之宜，宜镇四方，为国藩辅。宣扬德美，广耀威灵；乃国家之良规，海内所瞻望。但臣言辞鄙野，不能究尽其意。愚以二宫，宜有降杀〖4〗；正上下之序，明教化之本。”书三四上。为傅尽忠，动辄规谏。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":148},{"id":"shiyi-q-06aabd8f5a59027cdc7c","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-c0b95a4bbeb38a37b8ed","layer":"original","quote":"吕壹历白将相大臣，或一人以罪闻者数四，独无以白仪","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":85,"end":109},{"id":"shiyi-q-2d75d7644ed69a1b07c5","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-1452a7fc20d82acba6af","layer":"original","quote":"既定荆州，都武昌。拜裨将军。后封都亭侯，守侍中。欲复授兵，仪自以非材，固辞不受。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"shiyi-q-2f1149b6a74d573dcae1","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18db2fb2ebbe8aeeff67","layer":"original","quote":"权闻之，幸仪舍，求视蔬饭，亲尝之；对之叹息，即增俸赐，益田宅。仪累辞让，以恩为戚","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":110,"end":150},{"id":"shiyi-q-3cfc168d09fd5b39e294","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-a1f93cc44934f08efa45","layer":"original","quote":"典校郎吕壹，诬白故江夏太守刁嘉谤讪国政〖3〗；权怒，收嘉系狱，悉验问〖4〗。时同坐人皆怖畏壹，并言闻之；仪独云“无闻”。于是见穷诘累日〖5〗，诏旨转厉；群臣为之屏息〖6〗。仪对曰：“今刀锯已在臣颈，臣何敢为嘉隐讳？自取夷灭，为不忠之鬼！顾以闻知当有本末〖7〗。”据实答问，辞不倾移。权遂舍之，嘉亦得免。﹝一﹞","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":154},{"id":"shiyi-q-4beddea9c99fba0edc1d","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-55791b50b56b54923cdf","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞徐众《评》曰：“古之建姓：或以所生，或以官号，或以祖名；皆有义体，以明氏族。故曰‘胙之以土而命之氏’，此先王之典也；所以明本重始，彰示功德，子孙不忘也。今离文析字，横生忌讳；使仪易姓，忘本诬祖：不亦谬哉！教人易姓，从人改族；融既失之，仪又不得也。”","attribution":"徐众《评》","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":19,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-88a58856c9bdf2e9d5f7","start":0,"end":127},{"id":"shiyi-q-537666de480727882106","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-575fa66bbceefbf95dd0","layer":"original","quote":"黄武中，遣仪之皖〖8〗，就将军刘邵，欲诱致曹休","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23},{"id":"shiyi-q-5df433b12baa46f4c6b7","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-c0b95a4bbeb38a37b8ed","layer":"original","quote":"权尝责仪以“不言事，无所是非”。仪对曰：“圣主在上，臣下守职；惧于不称，实不敢以愚管之言〖8〗，上干天听〖9〗。”","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":17,"end":74},{"id":"shiyi-q-5ef7a45f96d0b1afb186","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-eed82b28f20a73bee4e9","layer":"original","quote":"进封都乡侯","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":37,"end":42},{"id":"shiyi-q-5fef5d97ed5098674b8e","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-c0b95a4bbeb38a37b8ed","layer":"original","quote":"事国数十年，未尝有过","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":74,"end":84},{"id":"shiyi-q-65a1cb26cba004bf5dd9","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-ee64888b280eee063611","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：是仪、徐详、胡综，皆孙权之时干兴事业者也〖1〗。仪清恪贞素〖2〗，详数通使命，综文采才用，各见信任；譬之广厦，其榱椽之佐乎〖3〗！","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68},{"id":"shiyi-q-6bc83e76763c24fcad2f","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-e807b155242677440928","layer":"original","quote":"郡相孔融嘲仪〖2〗，言“氏”字“民”无上〖3〗，可改为“是”：乃遂改焉","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":64},{"id":"shiyi-q-7e4411207319f6954909","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-575fa66bbceefbf95dd0","layer":"original","quote":"入阙，省尚书事〖9〗，外总平诸官〖10〗，兼领辞讼。又令教诸公子书学","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":36,"end":70},{"id":"shiyi-q-7eb3876f26f0b1ddb70b","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-c9f1ce4824eba5fbc716","layer":"original","quote":"后依刘繇，避乱江东。繇军败，仪徙会稽","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18},{"id":"shiyi-q-82494de5532c9d66f69d","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18db2fb2ebbe8aeeff67","layer":"original","quote":"事上勤，与人恭。不治产业，不受施惠；为屋舍，才足自容。邻家有起大宅者，权出望见，问：“起大室者谁？”左右对曰：“似是仪家也。”权曰：“仪俭，必非也！”问果他家。其见知信如此。服不精细，食不重膳〖5〗；拯赡贫困，家无储蓄。权闻之，幸仪舍，求视蔬饭，亲尝之；对之叹息，即增俸赐，益田宅。仪累辞让，以恩为戚〖6〗。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":154},{"id":"shiyi-q-837626b810d13ff5496a","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-e807b155242677440928","layer":"original","quote":"初为县吏，后仕郡","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":20,"end":28},{"id":"shiyi-q-896289dfc70cc49fa645","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-575fa66bbceefbf95dd0","layer":"original","quote":"迁偏将军","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":6,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":31,"end":35},{"id":"shiyi-q-8d866b7732a1c0bc4b58","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-eed82b28f20a73bee4e9","layer":"original","quote":"使仪辅太子，太子敬之，事先咨询，然后施行","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":36},{"id":"shiyi-q-8e181003ded4b8c3c7cf","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-c8370acfb358abd3787b","layer":"original","quote":"及寝疾，遗令：素棺，敛以时服，务从省约。年八十一卒","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25},{"id":"shiyi-q-8fd225d80f739b152db1","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18db2fb2ebbe8aeeff67","layer":"original","quote":"事上勤，与人恭","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7},{"id":"shiyi-q-979e1a624732c3c825e0","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-9d8a94393feeb6839493","layer":"original","quote":"吕蒙图袭关羽，权以问仪；仪善其计，劝权听之","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"shiyi-q-a750c78f06cb64fb0023","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-e807b155242677440928","layer":"original","quote":"是仪字子羽，北海营陵人也","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12},{"id":"shiyi-q-ac4205c9028dd170a8cc","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-fcfcaaea151f924e2967","layer":"original","quote":"孙权承摄大业，优文征仪〖4〗。到，见亲任，专典机密，拜骑都尉","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30},{"id":"shiyi-q-ade3571569747d47741b","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-c0b95a4bbeb38a37b8ed","layer":"original","quote":"权叹曰：“使人尽如是仪，当安用科法为〖10〗！”","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":110,"end":134},{"id":"shiyi-q-b231c5b0d583ffd9ad98","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-3c4291467a968e04ab7b","layer":"original","quote":"后拜尚书仆射","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":31,"end":37},{"id":"shiyi-q-b6f1dc8d809e76fd73d5","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-1452a7fc20d82acba6af","layer":"original","quote":"欲复授兵，仪自以非材，固辞不受","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":39},{"id":"shiyi-q-bdb59e4f9412f3accf34","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-0573513bcb6552456968","layer":"original","quote":"后从太子还建业，复拜侍中，中执法〖2〗；平诸官事，领辞讼如旧","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30},{"id":"shiyi-q-bfc490a77b71ebccc68f","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18ef2ce50d8fb8def8db","layer":"original","quote":"南、鲁二宫初立〖1〗，仪以本职领鲁王傅。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shiyi-q-c562e5964a85d0c26003","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18db2fb2ebbe8aeeff67","layer":"original","quote":"服不精细，食不重膳〖5〗；拯赡贫困，家无储蓄","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":87,"end":109},{"id":"shiyi-q-cc75a3414def1a003cb8","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-50cef559359027d15c72","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞徐众《评》曰：“是仪以羁旅异方，客仕吴朝；值谗邪殄行，当严毅之威，命悬漏刻，祸急危机；不雷同以害人，不苟免以伤义：可谓忠勇公正之士！虽祁奚之免叔向，庆忌之济朱云，何以尚之？忠不谄君，勇不慑耸，公不存私，正不党邪；资此四德，加之以文敏，崇之以谦约，履之以和顺：保傅二宫，存身爱名，不亦宜乎！”","attribution":"徐众《评》","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fb54a83264eb247f9786","start":0,"end":148},{"id":"shiyi-q-cf80cf8c1a137f906801","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-e807b155242677440928","layer":"original","quote":"是仪字子羽，北海营陵人也〖1〗。本姓氏。初为县吏，后仕郡；郡相孔融嘲仪〖2〗，言“氏”字“民”无上〖3〗，可改为“是”：乃遂改焉。﹝一﹞","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68},{"id":"shiyi-q-d3b6298b042e69342bb4","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-3c4291467a968e04ab7b","layer":"original","quote":"蜀相诸葛亮卒，权垂心西州〖8〗；遣仪使蜀，申固盟好：奉使称意。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31},{"id":"shiyi-q-d4aa0a597ababb5cc48b","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18db2fb2ebbe8aeeff67","layer":"original","quote":"其见知信如此","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":80,"end":86},{"id":"shiyi-q-d5dacfbee24ec9638406","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-c0b95a4bbeb38a37b8ed","layer":"original","quote":"时时有所进达〖7〗，未尝言人之短","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16},{"id":"shiyi-q-df71c4309624e1aae1a5","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-b31f3eb400a8ebab33df","layer":"original","quote":"封综、仪、详，皆为亭侯","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":63,"end":74},{"id":"shiyi-q-dfc82aabb7524585d4a7","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18ef2ce50d8fb8def8db","layer":"original","quote":"为傅尽忠，动辄规谏","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":138,"end":147},{"id":"shiyi-q-dff818c28c39c78c9c0a","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-9d8a94393feeb6839493","layer":"original","quote":"从讨羽，拜忠义校尉〖5〗；仪陈谢，权令曰：“孤虽非赵简子〖6〗，卿安得不自屈为周舍邪〖7〗！”","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":22,"end":69},{"id":"shiyi-q-e634c21b77ad605300a6","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-e807b155242677440928","layer":"original","quote":"本姓氏","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":19},{"id":"shiyi-q-f1e3c12ece1bf697c93a","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-274cf27e18898b898671","layer":"original","quote":"权为车骑将军，都京〖7〗；召综还，为书部〖8〗，与是仪、徐详俱典军国密事","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":33,"end":69},{"id":"shiyi-q-f2bd23994848c41ed15f","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18db2fb2ebbe8aeeff67","layer":"original","quote":"不治产业，不受施惠；为屋舍，才足自容","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":8,"end":26},{"id":"shiyi-q-ff42f6ad1ad527d5d50e","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18ef2ce50d8fb8def8db","layer":"original","quote":"仪嫌二宫相近切〖2〗，乃上疏曰：“臣窃以鲁王天挺懿德〖3〗，兼资文武；当今之宜，宜镇四方，为国藩辅。宣扬德美，广耀威灵；乃国家之良规，海内所瞻望。但臣言辞鄙野，不能究尽其意。愚以二宫，宜有降杀〖4〗；正上下之序，明教化之本。”书三四上","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":20,"end":137}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
